{"unit_id":"tag:03QD:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾Hensel引理。此引理有许多版本。以下给出两个：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(f)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 若<MATH_0001>首一（monic），且<MATH_0002>满足<MATH_0003>，则<MATH_0004>因式分解（factors）为<MATH_0005>，满足<MATH_0006>及<MATH_0007>，\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(r)<ITEMCLOSE_0002> 若<MATH_0008>、首一（monic）的<MATH_0009>、<MATH_0010>，但<MATH_0011>，则存在<MATH_0012>，满足<MATH_0013>及<MATH_0014>。\n<STRUCT_0003>\n两个版本均成立（我们将在后面看到）。第一个版本要求因式分解（factorizations）为互素（coprime）部分（parts）的提升（lifts），第二个版本要求模极大（maximal）理想（ideal）的单根（simple roots）的提升（lifts）。事实上，对一般局部环（local ring）要求这些条件是等价（equivalent）的，且与许多其他条件等价（equivalent）。我们以根提升（root lifting）性质作为Hensel（henselian）局部环（local ring）的定义，因为这通常最容易检查。\n\n<COMMENT_0001>","allowed_english":["Hensel","f","r"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"monic","target_term":"首一"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"因式分解"},{"source_term":"monic","target_term":"首一"},{"source_term":"factorizations","target_term":"因式分解"},{"source_term":"coprime","target_term":"互素"},{"source_term":"parts","target_term":"部分"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"maximal","target_term":"极大"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"simple roots","target_term":"单根"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"root lifting","target_term":"根提升"},{"source_term":"henselian","target_term":"Hensel"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"monic","target_term":"首一","context":"多项式性质。"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"因式分解","context":"多项式分解。"},{"source_term":"factorizations","target_term":"因式分解","context":"多项式分解。"},{"source_term":"coprime","target_term":"互素","context":"因子互素。"},{"source_term":"parts","target_term":"部分","context":"分解中的互素部分。"},{"source_term":"lifts","target_term":"提升","context":"分解或根的提升。"},{"source_term":"maximal","target